sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Nguoi dan (Citizen)
    participant UI as React Web App (Camera API)
    participant Ctrl as WasteScanController
    participant Svc as WasteScanService
    participant AIClient as AiVisionHttpClient
    participant FastAPI as Python FastAPI (AI Container)
    participant R2 as CloudflareR2Service
    participant Rule as WasteRuleEngineService
    participant Repo as AIScanHistoryRepository
    participant DB as PostgreSQL (ApplicationDbContext)

    User->>+UI: 1. Chup anh rac hoac tai anh tu may
    UI->>+Ctrl: 2. POST /api/v1/waste-scans/classify (multipart: file, model)
    Ctrl->>+Svc: 3. ClassifyWasteAsync(userId, stream, fileName, model, ct)
    
    Svc->>+AIClient: 4. ClassifyWasteImageAsync(stream, fileName, model, ct)
    AIClient->>+FastAPI: 5. HTTP POST /predict (bytes, model)
    Note over FastAPI: 1. YOLOv8: Bounding Box & Crop rac<br/>2. CNN: Phan loai chat lieu chi tiet
    
    alt Xu ly thanh cong trong 15s
        FastAPI-->>-AIClient: 6. 200 OK { top_prediction: "plastic", confidence: 0.89, is_ood: false }
        AIClient-->>-Svc: 7. Return AiScanResultDto
        
        Svc->>+R2: 8. UploadImageAsync(stream, fileName, ct)
        R2-->>-Svc: 9. Return imageUrl (https://pub-r2.ecolink.vn/...)
        
        Svc->>+Rule: 10. GetSortingGuideAsync(categoryCode="plastic", ct)
        Rule-->>-Svc: 11. Return WasteSortingGuideDto (BinColor, Steps, Warning)
        
        alt Confidence >= 0.60 (Nhan dien an toan)
            Svc->>+Repo: 12. AddAsync(AIScanHistory { status: Completed, score: 0.89 })
            Repo->>+DB: 13. INSERT INTO ai_scan_histories ...
            DB-->>-Repo: 14. 1 row affected (scan_id)
            Repo-->>-Svc: 15. Complete Task
            Svc-->>Ctrl: 16. Return WasteScanResponseDto (Ket qua tu tin)
        else Confidence < 0.60 (Out-of-Distribution / Canh bao)
            Svc->>+Repo: 12b. AddAsync(AIScanHistory { status: Low_Confidence, score: 0.45 })
            Repo->>+DB: 13b. INSERT INTO ai_scan_histories ...
            DB-->>-Repo: 14b. 1 row affected (scan_id)
            Repo-->>-Svc: 15b. Complete Task
            Svc-->>Ctrl: 16b. Return WasteScanResponseDto (Canh bao do tin cay thap)
        end
        Ctrl-->>-UI: 17. 200 OK: ApiResponse<WasteScanResponseDto> (MSG-CLS-01)
        UI-->>-User: 18. Hien thi Dialog ket qua & huong dan lam sach (SCR-USR-02)
    else Qua thoi gian 15s hoac AI Service loi (NFR-PER-01)
        FastAPI-->>-AIClient: 504 Gateway Timeout / Service Unavailable
        activate AIClient
        AIClient-->>-Svc: Throw TimeoutException
        deactivate AIClient
        Svc-->>-Ctrl: Fallback: Chuyen sang flow chon thu cong
        Ctrl-->>-UI: 503 Service Unavailable / 422: ApiResponse (MSG-CLS-03)
        UI-->>-User: Bat giao dien chon danh muc rác bang tay
    end
